@Webhooks.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7118

### Create order

POST {{Webhooks.Api_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName":"string",
  "amount":123
}


### Create subscription

POST {{Webhooks.Api_HostAddress}}/webhooks/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType":"order.created",
  "webhookUrl":"https://webhook.site/ce9f79f0-cd0e-4066-9476-fcd7d5256a63"
}